   "description": "Our team in ANZ is noticing the Analytics Dashboard is taking a very long time to load reports. It's not totally broken, just slow. I'm trying to figure out if this is a database query issue on the dashboard side or if our external webhooks that feed data into the dashboard are backing up and causing the UI to wait. Can you check if it's the rendering or the incoming data stream that's the bottleneck?"
